      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: keeping-your-dishwasher-clean; hasOverallIntent: informative; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a person loading dishes into a dishwasher in a kitchen, with overlaid text stating 'keeping your dishwasher clean will make it last longer.' The scene is straightforward and focuses on household maintenance advice. There is no toxicity present, as the content is neutral, practical, and aimed at providing useful information about appliance care. The intent is to educate or remind viewers about the benefits of regular dishwasher maintenance to extend its lifespan, using a relatable domestic scenario. No harmful, hateful, abusive, cyberbullying, misogynistic, or propagandistic elements are present.",
